1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,800
Prompt to 3D design?

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:04,000
Let us make it real.

3
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:08,200
Codex controls FreeCAD
to build this rounded box.

4
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:11,600
It hollows the shell
and adds four screw posts.

5
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:15,700
The removable lid gets three holes
for lights and two for switches.

6
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,450
Change 16 millimetres to 19.

7
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:20,250
The holes update.

8
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:23,150
Then restore the original size.

9
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,600
Lift the lid to inspect
the separate parts.

10
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:29,450
Add illustrative controls
and check the geometry.

11
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:33,150
The editable model is exported
for the next step.

12
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,650
Actual CAD work,
captured on screen.

13
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:39,350
Hardware fit still needs checking.

14
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,000
One design brief. Editable 3D.
